# The views are GENERATED from tasks/*.md — we do not version them.
#
# The reason is not cosmetic: INDEX.yaml and archive/done.yaml are sorted
# aggregates of ALL tasks, so every branch rewrites the same file and two
# branches conflict even when they share no task.
#
# To rebuild them: worktrail build
INDEX.yaml
NOW.yaml
archive/done.yaml
boards/*/INDEX.yaml
boards/*/NOW.yaml
viewer.html

# The local reconciliation reference point — NOT a source of truth.
history/.snapshot.json
